      "releaseNotes": "Draw to Fix GPS Gaps\nLost signal in a tunnel or under tree cover? Now you can finger-draw the missing stretch of your route right on the map. Fuse rebuilds the path and recalculates your distance — no more broken maps or straight-line jumps across town.\n\nChange Workout Type\nRecorded an Indoor Walk that should've been an Outdoor Walk? Convert any workout to a different activity type in a couple of taps, with all your data kept intact.\n\nPlus general improvements and fixes.\n\nHave feedback? You can reach us right from the app in Settings. Thanks for using Fuse!",
      "version": "1.4.0",
